    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game adds a twist to the Rogue-like Deck builder genre by separating the combat in two phases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the first phase you will load your revolver with the cards you want to use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then, the shooting begins, where you will &quot;shoot&quot; your cards one by one, while the enemy &quot;shoots&quot; back in-between. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081790/extras/3dd0315760b12a18bd4fae933740c383.poster.avif?t=1749814267\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081790/extras/3dd0315760b12a18bd4fae933740c383.webm?t=1749814267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081790/extras/3dd0315760b12a18bd4fae933740c383.mp4?t=1749814267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each game takes place in a new unique map where cards battles won't be the only way to progress and upgrade your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will find duels, where the faster shooter wins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Saloons were you will find good deals on cards to add to your deck and have a drink to help you recover some health (don't drink too much or you will get dizzy).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081790/extras/6b77d372ef16f09f26d0489601748ea7.poster.avif?t=1749814267\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081790/extras/6b77d372ef16f09f26d0489601748ea7.webm?t=1749814267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081790/extras/6b77d372ef16f09f26d0489601748ea7.mp4?t=1749814267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal is to beat the boss at the end of the level to go further into more complicated and fun encounters as your deck of cards evolves.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game adds a twist to the Rogue-like Deck builder genre by separating the combat in two phases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the first phase you will load your revolver with the cards you want to use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then, the shooting begins, where you will &quot;shoot&quot; your cards one by one, while the enemy &quot;shoots&quot; back in-between. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081790/extras/3dd0315760b12a18bd4fae933740c383.poster.avif?t=1749814267\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081790/extras/3dd0315760b12a18bd4fae933740c383.webm?t=1749814267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081790/extras/3dd0315760b12a18bd4fae933740c383.mp4?t=1749814267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each game takes place in a new unique map where cards battles won't be the only way to progress and upgrade your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will find duels, where the faster shooter wins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Saloons were you will find good deals on cards to add to your deck and have a drink to help you recover some health (don't drink too much or you will get dizzy).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081790/extras/6b77d372ef16f09f26d0489601748ea7.poster.avif?t=1749814267\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081790/extras/6b77d372ef16f09f26d0489601748ea7.webm?t=1749814267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081790/extras/6b77d372ef16f09f26d0489601748ea7.mp4?t=1749814267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal is to beat the boss at the end of the level to go further into more complicated and fun encounters as your deck of cards evolves.</p>",
